l8p_rowc: record l8p round 10, Layer 4 register row (c): L4A-66 (RE-10 and HO-A by M-A) and L4A-65 (HO-B, path 2's retry energy)
(MESHSAT-1357, 7 October 2026). Desk arithmetic on the makers' printed figures and the records' own; nothing was built, bought or
measured. LABELS: PRINTED; TYPICAL (never a limit); READING (this record's reading of a maker's drawing from its vector paths);
INFERRED; MODEL (a record's conductor model); RECORD (another record's figure, read from its file); ASSUMED.

